17. Compliance and Termination

Your rights under this License terminate automatically when You violate a
condition of this License.

If this is Your first violation of this License and You fully cure it before
receiving actual written notice from an affected Licensor, Your rights are
automatically reinstated effective upon full cure. If You receive actual
written notice before fully curing that first violation, Your rights are
automatically reinstated effective upon full cure only if You cure no later
than thirty (30) days after receiving the notice. A cure must include, as
applicable, stopping the violation, removing noncompliant distributions or
access restrictions, providing missing Corresponding Source or notices,
correcting misuse of the Vanylith Marks, and completing other reasonable
corrective action necessary to bring the activity into compliance.

Automatic reinstatement is not available for a repeated violation after cure,
an intentional recurrence of the same or a substantially similar violation, or
a continuing uncured violation. After such a violation, rights may be restored
only by the affected Licensor in writing. Termination of Your rights does not
terminate the rights of recipients who received compliant copies from You and
remain in compliance themselves.

